   "bucket": "reasoning",
   "planned_path": "P5",
   "scion_answer": "To round $6287215$ to the nearest ten thousand, we examine the digits:\n\n$$6287215$$\n\nThe digit in the **ten thousands** place is $8$, and the digit in the **thousands** place is $7$.\n\nSince $7 \\geq 5$, we round **up**.\n\nThis changes the ten thousands digit from $8$ to $9$, and sets all smaller digits to $0$:\n\n$$6287215 \\rightarrow 6290000$$\n\nVerification:\n- $6287215 - 6280000 = 7215$\n- $6290000 - 6287215 = 2785$\n\nSince $2785 < 7215$, $6290000$ is closer.\n\n$$\\boxed{6290000}$$",
